    "body": "Hi, I think we're going off topic here. The best place for questions about the Bluetooth specifications themselves, is at bluetooth.com (navigate to Contact Us and you'll find Ask a Question in there).\r\n\r\nBut.... yes. However, Mesh Proxy Data Out does not support READ. It supports NOTIFY only. See 7.2.3 of the Mesh Profile specification.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nMartin",
    "author_association": "NONE",
